{"version":1,"content":"<p>市場研究機構TrendForce近日發佈報告稱，蘋果新一代OLED版MacBook Pro預計將在2027年實現120萬至150萬台出貨量。作為MacBook Pro系列首次採用串聯式OLED顯示技術的產品，這款新品的上市被認為將進一步推動OLED筆記本市場的發展，並為整個產業鏈帶來新的增長動力。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/funny/1584458.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T10:32:05.910903+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T10:19:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.990685+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.990685+00:00","content_hash":"d274bdcd1eeecad6ca8f0eb5694e54dcae7fd33b66555a227f0506d9a0a96c49","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}